# Raw datasets (large, provided out-of-band)
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root — without it, a bare
# "data/" also matches src/chd/data/ (the Python subpackage) at any depth
# and silently excludes it from every `git add`, which is exactly what
# happened here: the pushed commit was missing src/chd/data/ entirely.
/dataset
/data/
/runs/
/reports/
/outputs/

# Model weights & caches
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx
!requirements.txt

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
